<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>To all my needs both great and small</l><l>Thou art the rich supply;</l><l>So ready and sufficient too</l><l>For me now to apply.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Thy sweet anointing with Thy might</l><l>In weakness doth sustain;</l><l>By Thy supply of energy</l><l>My strength Thou dost maintain.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Thy law of life in heart and mind</l><l>My conduct regulates;</l><l>The wealth of Thy reality</l><l>My being saturates.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>O Thou art ever one with me,</l><l>Unrivaled unity!</l><l>One spirit with me all the time</l><l>For all eternity!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
